        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "He walked the whole way at the same pace.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0002",
      "RegionId": "RG003",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 246,
        "Bottom": 299,
        "Left": 308,
        "Right": 537,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "I like to think he was thinking of me as he went, thinking of the old days, of family.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0003",
      "RegionId": "RG005",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 354,
        "Bottom": 390,
        "Left": 248,
        "Right": 411,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "But that\u0027s selfishness. And I know better.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0004",
      "RegionId": "RG007",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 761,
        "Bottom": 804,
        "Left": 388,
        "Right": 452,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "I TOLD YOU SO.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0005",
      "RegionId": "RG009",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 920,
        "Bottom": 975,
        "Left": 73,
        "Right": 174,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "I HAD TO SEE FOR MYSELF.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0006",
      "RegionId": "RG010",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 929,
        "Bottom": 991,
        "Left": 1491,
        "Right": 1600,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "JUST...\nTHERE FOR THE\nTAKING.",
      "Source": "baberu",
      "Accepted": true,
      "Reason": "bubble_text_region"
    },
    {
      "EvidenceId": "BO0007",
      "RegionId": "RG012",
      "Bounds": {
        "Top": 936,
        "Bottom": 1031,
        "Left": 1832,
        "Right": 1966,
        "Location": {},
        "Size": {},
        "TopLeft": {},
        "BottomRight": {}
      },
      "Text": "IT DOFSN\u0027T MATTER THOUGH. IT WAS ONE BATTLE IN A WAR THAT\u0027S LONG...",
